        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "So the payoff here is simple: we didn’t trade quality for cost. The smaller RFT model preserved the optimized contract-policy expert behavior across the baseline evaluation suite, with a 0.944 grader score, while reducing estimated inference cost by roughly 82%.\nNot bad!\n",
      "demo_actions": "Close on the full loop: reward function, training scenarios, and evaluation results. Summarize RFT in Foundry as a way to move work from a larger expensive model to a smaller cheaper one, while holding onto acceptable decision quality.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260703_124654_711_6.jpg"
    }
